    "yt-dlp 看得到這個片單有 %lld 支，卻一支也解不出來——你裝的是 %@，上游已經出到 %@。用 `brew upgrade yt-dlp` 更新後再按「重新解析」。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "yt-dlp can see %lld videos in this playlist but resolved none of them — you have %@ installed and upstream is already at %@. Update with `brew upgrade yt-dlp`, then press Resolve Again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "yt-dlp 看得到這個片單有 %1$lld 支，卻一支也解不出來——你裝的是 %2$@，上游已經出到 %3$@。用 `brew upgrade yt-dlp` 更新後再按「重新解析」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "yt-dlp 看得到這個片單有 %lld 支，卻一支也解不出來——這個站的 extractor 追不上網站改版。你的 yt-dlp%@沒有更新的版本可裝，更新它沒有用；等上游修好，或到 yt-dlp 的 issue 區回報。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "yt-dlp can see %lld videos in this playlist but resolved none of them — this site’s extractor has fallen behind a site change. Your yt-dlp%@ has no newer version to install, so updating will not help; wait for an upstream fix, or report it on the yt-dlp issue tracker."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "yt-dlp 看得到這個片單有 %1$lld 支，卻一支也解不出來——這個站的 extractor 追不上網站改版。你的 yt-dlp%2$@沒有更新的版本可裝，更新它沒有用；等上游修好，或到 yt-dlp 的 issue 區回報。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
