    "「輪到第幾支影片了」這種執行狀態，以及**哪台螢幕改用影片**。前者兩台同步只會互相打斷輪替；後者存的是顯示器 UUID，內建螢幕每台機器都不同——同步它只會把另一台的勾清掉。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Runtime state such as which video the rotation is on, and **which displays use video**. Syncing the former would just make two Macs interrupt each other’s rotation; the latter stores display UUIDs, and a built-in display’s UUID differs on every Mac — syncing it would only clear the other machine’s checkmarks."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「輪到第幾支影片了」這種執行狀態，以及**哪台螢幕改用影片**。前者兩台同步只會互相打斷輪替；後者存的是顯示器 UUID，內建螢幕每台機器都不同——同步它只會把另一台的勾清掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "・": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " · "
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "・"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上限 1 張＝每輪固定單張大圖，不再隨機。每台螢幕各自抽圖。降載時一樣是 1 張。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A limit of 1 means one large image every round, with no randomness. Every display still draws on its own. Under power saving it stays 1."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上限 1 張＝每輪固定單張大圖，不再隨機。每台螢幕各自抽圖。降載時一樣是 1 張。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
