    "來源設定會備份，**API key 不會**——備份檔是明文 JSON，放在 iCloud Drive 裡會被 Spotlight 索引。換機器時到「來源」分頁重輸一次。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Source settings are backed up, **API keys are not** — the backup is plain-text JSON and Spotlight indexes it inside iCloud Drive. Re-enter them in the Sources tab on the new machine."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "來源設定會備份，**API key 不會**——備份檔是明文 JSON，放在 iCloud Drive 裡會被 Spotlight 索引。換機器時到「來源」分頁重輸一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
