    "本機、SMB，以及 Box／pCloud／Dropbox／OneDrive／Google Drive 等雲端硬碟的掛載點——裝了桌面版就是一般資料夾，不需要 OAuth。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Local disks, SMB, and the mount points of cloud drives such as Box, pCloud, Dropbox, OneDrive and Google Drive — with the desktop client installed they are ordinary folders, so no OAuth is involved."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本機、SMB，以及 Box／pCloud／Dropbox／OneDrive／Google Drive 等雲端硬碟的掛載點——裝了桌面版就是一般資料夾，不需要 OAuth。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "桌布清單裡沒有 Foldwall？先把 app 從 /Applications 啟動一次，系統才會登錄它的 extension。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No Foldwall in the wallpaper list? Launch the app once from /Applications — the system only registers its extension then."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "桌布清單裡沒有 Foldwall？先把 app 從 /Applications 啟動一次，系統才會登錄它的 extension。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "桌面視窗**不會出現在鎖屏**。要鎖屏請改用系統桌布 extension。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
