    "連**名稱**一起存。相簿的 localIdentifier 每台機器都不同，就算兩台是同一個 iCloud 圖庫也對不上，所以跨機時靠名稱比對。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stored with their **names**. An album’s localIdentifier differs on every Mac and will not match even across one shared iCloud library, so names are what get matched across machines."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "連**名稱**一起存。相簿的 localIdentifier 每台機器都不同，就算兩台是同一個 iCloud 圖庫也對不上，所以跨機時靠名稱比對。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "選 **Shuffle All** 就會隨機輪播全部影片；想固定一支就直接點那支。隨機的切換頻率（喚醒時／5 分鐘／每天…）也在同一個畫面選。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pick **Shuffle All** to rotate through every video at random, or click one video to keep it fixed. The shuffle frequency (on wake / every 5 minutes / daily…) is set on the same screen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選 **Shuffle All** 就會隨機輪播全部影片；想固定一支就直接點那支。隨機的切換頻率（喚醒時／5 分鐘／每天…）也在同一個畫面選。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
