          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開啟系統設定": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open System Settings"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟系統設定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開著的話，這台的設定一改就寫上去，另一台也會自動套用。同一輪裡兩邊都改過就**以 iCloud 上那份為準**——沒有合併，後寫的贏。只想要單向搬家的話，用上面兩顆按鈕就好。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With this on, any change here is written up immediately and applied on your other Mac. If both changed in the same round, **the copy in iCloud wins** — there is no merging; the last write takes it. If all you want is a one-way move, the two buttons above are enough."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開著的話，這台的設定一改就寫上去，另一台也會自動套用。同一輪裡兩邊都改過就**以 iCloud 上那份為準**——沒有合併，後寫的贏。只想要單向搬家的話，用上面兩顆按鈕就好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
